{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“同伦纤维塔”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"同伦纤维塔"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"中, 一个同伦纤维塔是形如\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\t\\vdots &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n\tX_2 &amp; \\overset{f_2}{\\to} &amp; A_2 \\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n\tX_1 &amp; \\overset{f_1}{\\to} &amp; A_1 \\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n\tX_0 &amp; \\overset{f_0}{\\to} &amp; A_0\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n的图, 其中 $X_{n+1} \\to X_n \\overset{f_n}{\\to}A_n$ 为同伦纤维列.</p>\n<p>纤维列的同伦群长正合列\n$$\r\n\\pi_\\bullet(X_{\\bullet+1})\\to\\pi_\\bullet(X_\\bullet)\\to\\pi_\\bullet(A_\\bullet)\\to\\pi_{\\bullet -1}(X_{\\bullet+1})\r\n$$\n构成 (双分次 Abel 群的) "},{"Local":{"url":"正合偶","text":"正合偶"}},{"Plain":", 进而产生一个"},{"Local":{"url":"谱序列","text":"谱序列"}},{"Plain":", 其第一页是 $\\pi_\\bullet (A_\\bullet)$.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"滤过谱","text":"滤过谱"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 塔"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Adams谱序列","text":"Adams 谱序列"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}